WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.369
These are significantly sized holes.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.269
They are.

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.305
It was so loud.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.239
This happened

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:09.175
when my husband and I were asleep and

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:10.543
my grandkids

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.278
could have been spending the night.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.614
It was about a dozen bullets

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.916
fired into Debbie O'Malley's home.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.219
She was one of four Democratic officials

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:20.987
targeted in a series of drive

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:21.788
by shootings

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.257
weeks after the 2022 midterms.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.493
The Chicago Police shooting,

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.060
a newly

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.028
unsealed indictment

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.996
now reveals federal charges

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.232
against this man, Solomon Pena,

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:33.900
for being the mastermind

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.035
of the shootings.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.636
He's a former Republican candidate

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:38.738
on the 2022 ballot.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:42.308
Pena lost by a landslide but tweeted

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.810
he stood with Trump

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.812
and never conceded his own race

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.881
in New Mexico. Hi, my name's Solomon.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.549
Can I speak with Debbie O'Malley?

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.316
Ring video

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:51.751
from shortly after the election

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:52.352
captures him

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.954
going to one of the Democrats homes.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:56.322
Prosecutors

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:59.492
say he blamed them for his election loss.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.261
And according to the indictment, Pena

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.630
then texted those home addresses

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:04.831
to accomplices

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:07.067
to carry out the shootings, writing

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.469
They just certified it.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.538
They were literally laughing at us.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:13.740
Prosecutors say Pena directly

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.742
took part in two of the shootings.

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:17.677
None of the victims were injured.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.512
We've got the rest over here.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:20.847
Bernalillo County Commissioner

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:23.116
Adrian Balboa was also targeted.

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:25.185
Eight bullets were fired at her house,

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:27.120
four of them into the room

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:27.654
where she had

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:29.689
just been playing with her granddaughter.

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:30.690
It makes me angry

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.892
that one person makes it angry

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.394
that we have a former president

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.629
and current elected officials

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.164
in the highest level of government

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.467
that think it's okay to,

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:42.001
you know, invoke violence

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.203
in these situations.

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.504
As the country kicks off

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.239
another election cycle,

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.173
federal prosecutors

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:50.176
say the message from New Mexico is this.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.946
We all stand here together, united

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.181
to say that acts of violence

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.049
will never stop an

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.650
American from doing her duty.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.687
There are 11 federal

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:01.921
counts in this indictment.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.756
They vary from conspiracy

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.492
charges, election interference

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:07.560
to firearms violations.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.729
If convicted, Pena does face

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:12.332
a mandatory minimum of 60 years

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:13.099
behind bars.

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:13.533
And, Jake,

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.735
we did reach out to his attorney.

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:17.170
We did not hear back.

